  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Moles of <math><mi>N</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />&nbsp;</p><p>Molality is number of moles of solute present per Kg of Solvent</p><p>4 mole of <math><mi>N</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> are present in 1 kg of water Hence,&nbsp;molality of <math><mi>N</mi><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ions will be 4</p>",
